---
import LinkButton from "./linkButton.astro";
---

<section>
  <div>
    <h2 style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: var(--num-l);">
      At a glance
    </h2>
    <div class="cards">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Split Attraction Model</h3>
        <p>
          This is a framework that distinguishes between the different types of
          attraction that one might feel. It communicates to us that attractions
          don't always overlap with each other, so an asexual person might
          experience other attractions, such as homoromantic attraction.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Attraction Types</h3>
        <p>
          <b>Romantic</b>: Exercitation excepteur voluptate culpa officia
          deserunt occaecat veniam aliqua ut irure dolore.
        </p>
        <p>
          <b>Sexual</b>: Exercitation excepteur voluptate culpa officia deserunt
          occaecat veniam aliqua ut irure dolore.
        </p>
        <p>
          <b>Platonic</b>: Exercitation excepteur voluptate culpa officia
          deserunt occaecat veniam aliqua ut irure dolore.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Desire vs Attraction</h3>
        <p>
          <b>Attraction</b>: Exercitation excepteur voluptate culpa officia
          deserunt occaecat veniam aliqua ut irure dolore.
        </p>
        <p>
          <b>Desire</b>: Exercitation excepteur voluptate culpa officia deserunt
          occaecat veniam aliqua ut irure dolore.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="more">
      <p>There are many other terms to know about</p>
      <LinkButton link="/terms">Learn More</LinkButton>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  section {
    background-color: var(--clr-primary);
    padding-block: var(--num-l);
  }

  .cards {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--num-l);
  }

  .card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--num-m);
    background-color: var(--clr-secondary);
    padding: var(--num-m);
    border-radius: var(--num-s);
    box-shadow: 3px 3px 5px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.5);
    inline-size: 100%;
  }

  .more {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    inline-size: 100%;
    padding-block: var(--num-l);
    gap: var(--num-m);
  }
</style>
